# Next-page workflow

## Before coding a new screen
0. Identify the module: supervisor (`src/pages/*`, `Layout`, `mock.js`) or general admin (`src/pages/ga/*`, `GaLayout`, `mockGa.js`). Never edit one to serve the other.
1. Reuse `Layout` / `GaLayout` (title or in-page breadcrumb like RequestDetail).
2. Mirror spacing/typography from the closest accepted page (Dashboard / RequestList / RequestDetail / UsersList).
3. Put **presentation** data in the module's mock file; keep Arabic field labels. Business data both modules act on (requests, notes, users, stages) belongs in `src/domain/` — see the baseline rule's integration section.
4. Wire route in `src/App.jsx` and nav only if product asks.

